    "title": "LumiDesk — Legal Notice (Imprint)",
    "html": "<h1>LumiDesk — Legal Notice (Imprint)</h1>\n<p><strong>DRAFT — not legal advice.</strong> This is a practical starting point prepared for planning. Some countries (e.g. Germany, Austria) have specific mandatory imprint content; have a qualified lawyer confirm what your target markets require before you publish. Fill the bracketed <code>[…]</code> fields once the company is registered.</p>\n<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 6 November 2026</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Service provider</h2>\n<p>LumiDesk is an AI phone-receptionist service operated by:</p>\n<p><strong>[DeepO3 — legal entity to be registered in Finland]</strong>\n[Registered address, Finland]\nCountry: Finland\nCompany registration number: [company registration number — pending]\nVAT / business ID: [VAT / Y-tunnus — pending]</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> DeepO3 is in the process of being registered as a legal entity in Finland. The registered company name, number, and address will be added here once registration is complete.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Contact</h2>\n<p>Email: [contact email]\n[Phone, optional]</p>\n<h2>Responsible for content</h2>\n<p>[Name of person responsible], DeepO3, Finland.</p>\n<h2>Supervisory authority (data protection)</h2>\n<p>Office of the Data Protection Ombudsman (Tietosuojavaltuutetun toimisto), Finland — the lead authority for data-protection matters in Finland.</p>\n<h2>Governing law</h2>\n<p>These pages and the LumiDesk service are governed by the laws of Finland and applicable EU law. See the <a href=\"./terms_of_service.md\">Terms of Service</a> and <a href=\"./privacy_policy.md\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>",
